    "plain": {
      "subject": "Quick question about missed calls",
      "body": "{{opening}}\n\nWhen someone calls and nobody can pick up, most people just call the next place on the list. Harbor Front Desk answers every call, text and WhatsApp in seconds, day or night, offers your open times, books them in, and hands you anything that needs you.\n\nIt sets itself up from your Google listing in a few minutes, and the first 14 days are free.\n\nWould it be worth a look?"
    },
    "supposes": {
      "subject": "Missed calls while you're with a customer",
      "body": "{{opening}}\n\nI imagine the phone keeps ringing while you're busy with a customer, and some of those calls probably go to voicemail and never come back. That's often a customer who just calls the next place instead.\n\nWe built Harbor Front Desk to answer those calls for businesses like {{business}}, so fewer customers slip away while you're working.\n\nWould you be open to a quick look at how it could work for {{business}}?"
    }
